spec:
  id: learning_model
  version: 1.0.0
  status: stable
  priority: highest
  module: Cognition
  compiler_stage: Learning
  description: >
purpose[6]: Learn,adapt,generalize,specialize,improve,engineering cognition.
philosophy[5]: Learning changes behavior.,Experience is training data.,Reflection improves learning.,Knowledge compounds.,Better engineers continuously learn.
pipeline[13]: Observation,→,Experience,→,Reflection,→,Lesson,→,Memory Update,→,Capability Update,→,Generalization
inputs[9]: Engineering Knowledge Records,Knowledge Atoms,Engineering Memory,Reflection,Failures,Successes,Experiments,Benchmarks,User Feedback
outputs[6]: Updated Memory,Improved Capability,New Heuristic,Better Mental Model,Engineering Principle,Knowledge Graph Update
types[8]: Supervised,Self Supervised,Reinforcement,Transfer,Curriculum,Active,Continual,Meta Learning
acquisition[7]: Read,Observe,Experiment,Compare,Practice,Simulate,Reflect
consolidation[6]: Merge,Compress,Link,Generalize,Validate,Reinforce
generalization[4]: Local,Domain,Cross Domain,Universal
specialization[6]: Compiler,Operating System,Networking,AI,Security,Distributed Systems
transfer[12]: Algorithm,→,Compiler,Networking,→,Distributed Systems,Operating Systems,→,Databases,AI,→,Robotics
capabilities[7]: Beginner,→,Intermediate,→,Advanced,→,Expert
strategies[6]: Retrieval Practice,Spaced Repetition,Analogical Learning,Failure Driven Learning,Example Driven Learning,Project Based Learning
reinforcement[4]: Successful Decision,Successful Prediction,Production Validation,Correct Debugging
correction[4]: Contradiction,Failed Prediction,Production Failure,Invalid Assumption
memory[4]: Semantic,Episodic,Procedural,Organizational
reasoning[5]: Deduction,Induction,Abduction,Analogical,Counterfactual
ekr[6]: Every Engineering Knowledge Record,"contributes to:",Capability Growth,Memory Reinforcement,Knowledge Consolidation,Mental Model Improvement
validation[8]: Every learning event,has evidence.,Every capability improvement,is measurable.,Every lesson,updates memory.,Every correction,preserves history.
examples:
  Example_01:
    Experience: Deadlock Investigation
    Learning: Lock Ordering Pattern
  Example_02:
    Experience: Performance Benchmark
    Learning: Cache Locality Principle
  Example_03:
    Experience: Production Incident
    Learning: Retry Strategy
  Example_04:
    Experience: Code Review
    Learning: Better API Design
metrics[6]: Learning Rate,Capability Growth,Knowledge Retention,Transfer Success,Error Reduction,Generalization Score
success[5]: Engineering knowledge,"continually improves,","transfers across domains,",and increases reasoning quality,over time.
guarantees[5]: Continual Learning,Transferable Knowledge,Capability Growth,Memory Consolidation,Lifelong Engineering Improvement
future:
  self_directed_learning: true
  autonomous_curriculum: true
  adaptive_learning_paths: true
  capability_forecasting: true
  lifelong_engineering_learning: true
